<p class="note">
	{tr}Display a clock. With <kbd>src</kbd> set to <em>javascript</em> (24-hour) or <em>javascript12</em> (12-hour) the clock ticks in the browser; any other value shows the server time as text.{/tr}
	<br />
	<span class="example">{tr}Example:{/tr} <kbd>src=javascript12</kbd></span>
</p>

<dl>
	<dt class="param"><kbd>src</kbd></dt>
